,\n  \"ja\": {\n    \"language\": \"言語\",\n    \"hello\": \"こんにちは、世界！\"\n  }\n}\n</i18n>\n\n```\n\n### Vite Config\n\nthe below example that `examples/composable/vite.config.ts`:\n\n```js\nimport type { UserConfig } from 'vite'\nimport i18n from '@intlify/vite-plugin-vue-i18n'\n\nconst config: UserConfig = {\n  vueCustomBlockTransforms: {\n    i18n\n  }\n}\n\nexport default config\n\n```\n\n### Locale Messages formatting\n\nYou can be used by specifying the following format in the `lang` attribute:\n\n- json (default)\n- yaml\n- json5\n\nexample `yaml` foramt:\n\n```vue\n<i18n lang=\"yaml\">\nen:\n  hello: \"Hello World!\"\nja:\n  hello: \"こんにちは、世界！\"\n</i18n>\n```\n\n\n## :scroll: Changelog\nDetails changes for each release are documented in the [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/intlify/vite-plugin-vue-i18n/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md).\n\n\n## :exclamation: Issues\nPlease make sure to read the [Issue Reporting Checklist](https://github.com/inlitify/vite-plugin-vue-i18n/blob/master/.github/CONTRIBUTING.md#issue-reporting-guidelines) before opening an issue. Issues not conforming to the guidelines may be closed immediately.\n\n\n## :copyright: License\n\n[MIT](http://opensource.org/licenses/MIT)\n","engines":{"node":">= 10"},"gitHead":"0a8fc4b4869ec095b0ba577a3c0273a596286fc1","scripts":{"fix":"npm-run-all --parallel lint:fix format:fix","lint":"eslint ./src ./test --ext .ts","test":"yarn lint && yarn test:cover","build":"tsc -p .","clean":"npm-run-all clean:*","watch":"tsc -p . --watch","format":"prettier --config .prettierrc --ignore-path .prettierignore '**/*.{js,json,html}'","coverage":"opener coverage/lcov-report/index.html","lint:fix":"yarn lint --fix","test:e2e":"yarn build:example && jest --runInBand --config ./jest.e2e.config.js","clean:lib":"rm -rf ./lib/index.js","test:unit":"jest --env node","format:fix":"yarn format --write","test:cover":"yarn test:unit --coverage","test:watch":"jest --env node --watch","build:example":"yarn build && npm-run-all --parallel